ti/status/2109612327263719456"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109591596635488256","3_2109591610971537409","3_2109591624389136385","3_2109591638221946880"]},"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-12T10:26:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109591649815007260"],"id":"2109591649815007260","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":2278,"like_count":76,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":5},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108533573976506750","type":"quoted"}],"text":"📍 Chetla Agrani.\n\n🎨 N/A.\n\n🌟 N/A.\n\n👉 The pandal looks pretty good, but nothing extraordinary for their usual standards.\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 1/3 https://t.co/7hTe87NptF https://t.co/92sPkGv9CP","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109591649815007260"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109553538590445568"]},"author_id":"772693965627797504","created_at":"2026-10-12T07:55:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109553548271014290"],"id":"2109553548271014290","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":195,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Maddox Square &amp; Mudiali carry two very different neighbourhood rhythms, one shaped by Pujo, old homes &amp; familiar cultural landmarks; the other by Feluda memories, Menoka Cinema and the calm of Rabindra Sarobar. What’s your #AmarParaHiddenGems? Share it at https://t.co/VoWlgi6bjf https://t.co/3FKGSiLHu4","url":"https://x.com/TOIKolkata/status/2109553548271014290"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109537915839889408","3_2109537962837102592","3_2109538006206218241","3_2109538081422614528"]},"author_id":"1154229504199385088","created_at":"2026-10-12T06:54:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109538124703658350"],"id":"2109538124703658350","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":1279,"like_count":104,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":8},"text":"Divine &amp; Dreamy 🎨  A breathtaking pandal that reflects the artistic brilliance, cultural richness, and creative imagination of Bengal’s talented artists. 🎨🙏\n\nChorebagan Sarbojanin, \nKolkata Durgapuja2026 \n\n#durgapuja2026 #kolkatadurgapuja #durgapuja #culture #photooftheday https://t.co/p0PAsInzcC","url":"https://x.com/Caperspectives/status/2109538124703658350"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109529627475546112","3_2109529627496452096"]},"author_id":"51580260","created_at":"2026-10-12T06:20:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109529633326588148"],"id":"2109529633326588148","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":512,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":3},"text":"🪄THE NIGHT HOGWARTS CAME TO KOLKATA — AND A LAWSUIT THAT THREATENED THE MAGIC🪄\n\nOctober 2007. Durga Puja was approaching, and Salt Lake’s FD Block had an extraordinary surprise in store: a Hogwarts-inspired pandal, bringing the magical world of Harry Potter to the streets of https://t.co/nEUQLXtt3g","url":"https://x.com/WestBengalDiary/status/2109529633326588148"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109296279683776512","3_2109296296716906497"]},"author_id":"1313326464461283328","created_at":"2026-10-11T14:53:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109296330657153157"],"id":"2109296330657153157","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":1081,"like_count":70,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":3},"text":"Pujo is not Pujo without the OG Rudranis. Both Durga idols for 2026, for College Square and Ekdalia Evergreen, are out and currently in their pandals for the final touches. Padma Shri Sanatan Rudra Pal's signature touch brings them alive every time. The best of sabekis ✨💫 PC https://t.co/ks35m9SRbR","url":"https://x.com/horek_rokom/status/2109296330657153157"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109202485714034688","3_2109202494312316929","3_2109202502579335168","3_2109202510808559616"]},"author_id":"154897502","created_at":"2026-10-11T08:40:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109202518408589657"],"id":"2109202518408589657","public_met